      "adviceAction": "FullTransfer",
      "adviceActionRationale": [
        {
          "text": "The receiving scheme has a lower overall cost structure compared to your existing pension, meaning more of your savings remain invested for growth rather than being lost to charges. The platform charges with Aviva are 0.21% compared to the True Potential platform charges of 0.40%, this represents a saving of 0.19% or \u00A388.68 based on the current value of the fund.",
          "topic": "LowerPlatformCosts",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "linkedObjectiveIds": [
