            "documentId": "Suitability report 2026.md",
            "documentCategory": "I_RecommendationsAndAdvice",
            "pageNumbers": [
              10
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "By moving to the recommended scheme, I will have the ability to actively monitor and adjust your investments as required, helping to ensure they remain aligned with your changing needs and market conditions.",
